# V2-J F-42 (prompt 020): UI Automation control patterns, driven by a separate client process
# (spikes `uia-client` steps): Invoke the Settings title-bar button (the panel opens), Toggle
# a settings row (its ToggleState flips) and Expand the More menu (ExpandCollapseState and the
# popup). Every step acts through the pattern only; the app sees the same input path as a click.
command mode light
wait-idle
ui uia-client ../../target/release/uia-client.exe uia-patterns-1.tmp.txt invoke:Settings;toggle:Restore reading position
ui uia-wait
assert uia_exit == 0
wait-idle
key esc
wait-idle
sleep 300
ui uia-client ../../target/release/uia-client.exe uia-patterns-2.tmp.txt expand:More options
ui uia-wait
assert uia_exit == 0
assert popup_open == 1
key esc
wait-idle
assert popup_open == 0
command mode system
